{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>曾參與《魔音女團》兼年僅21歲新晉小花周智敏早前飛赴德國度假，罕有地在社交平台大派福利，展現與平日截然不同火辣 …</p><p></p>\n<p>曾參與《魔音女團》兼年僅21歲新晉小花周智敏早前飛赴德國度假，罕有地在社交平台大派福利，展現與平日截然不同火辣一面。她無預警換上極少布水着大騷傲人身材，成功將大眾視線由其歌唱實力轉移至出眾外在條件。這位被視為黑馬女新人背後其實隱藏住一個顛覆大眾認知破格決定。</p>\n<h2>周智敏慕尼黑海德堡之旅罕現惹火水着</h2>\n<p>周智敏前往德國慕尼黑以及海德堡等地放假充電，期間更連環釋出多張極具夏日氣息旅遊照片。染有一頭搶眼紅髮周智敏突然大解放，換上一套深色幼帶比堅尼，毫無保留地展現豐滿上圍及火辣線條。除了超吸睛水着照之外，她亦有穿上格仔連身裙於公園長椅打卡，甚至拿起巨型蝴蝶餅遮面扮可愛，以及趴在草坡上欣賞夕陽美景。</p>\n<h2>社交平台狂派福利展現最真實自我面貌</h2>\n<p>面對外界對於其罕有性感造型高度關注，周智敏選擇透過社交平台繼續與網民及粉絲進行互動。她主動將這批充滿生活感旅遊日常照片上載至網絡，大方與大眾分享身處異國放假心情。她透過連串生活動態更新，向外界展露脫下華麗舞台服飾後，私下穿著休閒服裝及素顏打卡等真實狀態。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481642888379422_1835032746afab9ade9150.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1787485187_3970034081108015049_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481642888379422_1835032746afab9ade9150.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948164341199644_13913600366afab9b292b6f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1787485187_3970034101106254596_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948164341199644_13913600366afab9b292b6f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>罕現惹火水着（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>放棄澳洲學位為追夢參加《聲秀》</h2>\n<p>其實周智敏從小視梅艷芳為偶像，更一直積極學習跳舞同埋彈結他。她在英國中學畢業後，為了留港追逐演藝夢想，毅然放棄澳洲大學學位，選擇入讀浸會大學流行音樂系。她早於2024年奪得《歌手的誕生大賽》季軍，去年參與《聲秀》時憑實力殺入總決賽並取得第6名，今年再接再厲出戰《魔音女團》，雖然最終落敗卻依然在網上獲得極高關注度。</p>\n<h2>大批網民湧入留言激讚外在條件超屈機</h2>\n<p>這輯德國旅行靚相一經曝光，隨即在社交媒體掀起極大迴響，大批粉絲及網民紛紛湧入其社交帳號留言。不少人對其深藏不露好身材感到驚訝，有網民直接留言大讚「身材太好了吧」，亦有人表示「歐遊好靚好Chill」。大眾焦點同時落在她兼備外貌與音樂底子之上，更有網民激動直指她「又有才華身材又正，簡直係女神」。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481643744063695_6611382306afab9b5cee51.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1788526862_3978773240994439086_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481643744063695_6611382306afab9b5cee51.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481644137584203_7983935736afab9b9d8454.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"emchow816_1783107838_3933312740898886367_64694652193.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481644137584203_7983935736afab9b9d8454.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481644540480474_19633213326afab9bdeabdc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6329868955299812633.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481644540480474_19633213326afab9bdeabdc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有份參加台慶Opening 隧道Mass Dance（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481644711129592_10669746886afab9bf71c72.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6329868955299812634.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481644711129592_10669746886afab9bf71c72.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948164491343144_11215460146afab9c1a9e9b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6329868955299812635.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948164491343144_11215460146afab9c1a9e9b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481645056394414_21207662936afab9c35ed18.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6329868955299812636.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179481645056394414_21207662936afab9c35ed18.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@emchow816）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176059125827749887_176841745868f07d9a96f9c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"聲秀 胡鴻鈞 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176059125827749887_176841745868f07d9a96f9c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>係《聲秀》嘅參賽者，最終攞到第六名。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176128946356528070_17242440768fb24f7c5c7b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"聲秀 甄敏芳 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176128946356528070_17242440768fb24f7c5c7b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/582914575_17909002329259339_4335939420895462175_n_1828596272691fdc512bf3e-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"聲夢傳奇 聲秀 （圖片來源：周智敏IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/582914575_17909002329259339_4335939420895462175_n_1828596272691fdc512bf3e-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：周智敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%91%a8%e6%99%ba%e6%95%8f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">周智敏</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%81%b2%e7%a7%80/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">聲秀</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%ad%94%e9%9f%b3%e5%a5%b3%e5%9c%98/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">魔音女團</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3543994\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 16 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T09:55:59.841751+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1393,"images":11,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T08:08:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T09:49:38.176002+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:49:38.176002+00:00","content_hash":"75887ae0bdf2cf3ade6d66cb33de7fc2bac5e2b799e582f4ebf3bf477e3c8ea4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}